# Eidos: me.md is local and never shared.
# Each person who works on this definition keeps their own me.md (here in .eidos/); the agent reads
# it to know who they are. It is the one file of the standard's own that is not checked in.
me.md

# Eidos: a tool's local.yaml and local/ stay on this machine and are never shared.
# A tool that keeps a folder under plugins/ keeps one person's settings in local.yaml (a viewer
# command, an editor, a key path) and one person's files in local/ (a cache, a scratch area);
# nothing else in its folder is local. These two lines cover every tool, so no tool writes a
# .gitignore of its own.
plugins/*/local.yaml
plugins/*/local/
